            "review_title": "Review at Gangnam BBQ",
            "review_text": "Uyen N\nMelbourne, Australia80 contributions\n0\nNice Korean food, friendly staff\nDec 2018 • Family\nWe enjoyed the beef bbq ordered 4 plates. They are all good\n\nThe hot pot was not so yummy may be we were full. It a bit pricey when considering what included in the pot.\n\nThey gave us two dishes on the house. Was good. Steam rice was free of charge\n\nWe also enjoy the rice wine\nThe staff who serving us was super quick and friendly her name starts with Kim. We had a good joke about Kim Korea family name\n\nOverall not perfect but highly recommended\nRead more\nWritten December 29, 2018",
