            "review_title": "Review at Gangnam BBQ",
            "review_text": "aaro k\n7 contributions\n0\nOverpriced poshy place.\nJan 2017 • Family\nI feel bit bad slashing the place, had a hot dog from some shop afterwards so I don't feel as disappointed as when we left the place. But to be honest this place was one star for us. It seems it's some kind of show-off place for rich people or something. The food was alright, we got a lot of weird stuff on small plates, no one explained to us what was what, we were really confused. The meat was nice, but there was like 7 small pieces of it, thought we ordered and paid for menu for two. Both of us were still hungry after eating. Not recommended for eating, but if you wanna put some fancy clothes on and pay double for half, this might be the place for you.\nRead more\nWritten January 24, 2017",
