            "review_title": "Review at Gangnam BBQ",
            "review_text": "JennTDee\n30 contributions\n0\nYummy Korean bbq\nSep 2016 • Family\nCame here to visit for lunch while we were driving around the area looking for some Korean bbq and came across this place around the corner. The place was completely packed with Koreans! Staff was friendly - their English was decent but there was some confusion in explaining what’s included in the beef bbq set order. Side dishes served were a bit too tiny. They almost felt like samples rather than dishes of appetizers.\n\nHowever, overall food was good and the prices were decent for Phu My Hung area.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 6, 2016",
